{attribute,{1,1},file,{"qlc_queries.erl",1}}.
{attribute,{1,2},module,qlc_queries}.
{attribute,{2,2},moduledoc,"qlc (plan 21 step LIB73): compiled query list comprehensions over lists, ets, dets and qlc:table/2\x{a}tables. Covers evaluation, folds and cursors, constant lookups and match specifications, merge and\x{a}lookup joins (with equal keys on temporary files), cache and unique options (lists spilled to\x{a}files), sorting, info/1,2 in all formats, and the runtime-only paths of qlc_plain. Clause compiles\x{a}qlc_queries.abstr, these forms after OTP's qlc transform; OTP compiles this file."}.
{attribute,{9,2},export,[{main,1}]}.
